  "prompt": "For each monthly cohort of accounts created from January to November 2025, how many accounts does it hold, and how many used the product in month 1, the calendar month after the cohort month? An account's cohort month is the month of its created_at (Brussels local time), and a usage week counts in the month its week_start falls in. The as-of date is 1 January 2026, so every month up to December 2025 has ended. Return three columns, in this order: cohort_month (the first day of the month), cohort_accounts and active_month_1. Return one row for each cohort month that has accounts. Any row order is fine.",
